# This repository is three services, and each one reads its own env file.
# There is nothing to configure at the root — copy the three below instead.
#
#   frontend/.env   (from frontend/.env.example)
#       The Vite SPA. Needs nothing in development: vite.config.ts proxies
#       /api to the portal, so the browser only ever calls relative paths.
#
#   backend/.env    (from backend/.env.example)
#       The Express portal on :4000 — auth, the AI-calling strategy engine,
#       and the server-side bridge to the ingestion service. Owns JWT_SECRET,
#       ENCRYPTION_KEY and TALLY_API_URL.
#
#   server/.env     (from server/.env.example)
#       The NestJS lead-ingestion service on :3001 — form-provider webhooks,
#       signature verification, field mapping and the processing worker.
#
# Never commit any of the three: they are gitignored, and between them they
# hold the database password, the JWT signing secret and the key that decrypts
# stored provider credentials.
